  "description": "My first love, the guy I’ve had a crush on for two years, is getting married to my best friend? I even went so far as to lie and say I liked the boss just to hide my true feelings… but he overheard me?! Moved by my words, the boss has decided to call off his engagement and marry me instead??! Can I dodge the full-speed charge of this headstrong guy, who’s running wild amid all these misunderstandings and misperceptions?!? I think I might have… tickled the boss’s nose hair while he was sleeping! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
